  "details": "<p>The\u00a0<em>tribus\u00a0Esquilina\u00a0</em>was one of the four, large, urban tribes of Rome (<em>Palatina</em>,\u00a0<em>Collina</em>,\u00a0<em>Esquilina</em>,\u00a0<em>Suburana</em>), which corresponded to the four urban regions that Servius Tullius created.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "The tribus Esquilina was one of the four urban tribes of Rome, which were reportedly created under the reign of Servius Tullius.",
